  "content": "\n\n<h1>Aimz - 更優的準星</h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">摘要</span></p>\n<p>為我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包量身打造的客製化準星。現已作為獨立版本釋出。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">說明</span></p>\n<p>透過將標準原版準星更換為許多其他遊戲中常見的現代化設計，進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗。</p>\n<p><br>尋找更多準星、字型或資源包嗎？歡迎查看我的其他專案 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/658/675/2023-05-09_01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"442\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即申請伺服器，與朋友們一同遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
